hemes":[{"name":"加密貨幣","count":5},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-10","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/38777/000003877725000238/ben-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Franklin Resources, Inc. (\"Franklin\") is a holding company with subsidiaries operating under our Franklin Templeton and/or subsidiary brand names. Franklin's common stock is traded on the New York Stock Exchange (the \"NYSE\") under the ticker symbol \"BEN\" and is included in the Standard & Poor's 500 Index. In this Annual Report, Franklin and its subsidiaries are collectively referred to as the \"Company,\" and words such as \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our\" and similar terms refer to the Company. We have one operating segment, investment management and related services.","zh":"Franklin Resources, Inc.（「富蘭克林」）是一家控股公司，旗下子公司均以富蘭克林鄧普頓和/或子公司品牌名稱營運。富蘭克林的普通股在紐約證券交易所（“NYSE”）交易，股票代號為“BEN”，並被納入標準普爾 500 指數。在本年報中，富蘭克林及其子公司統稱為“公司”，“我們”、“我們的”及類似術語均指本公司。我們有一個營運部門，投資管理及相關服務。"},{"en":"We offer our services and products under our various distinct brand names, including, but not limited to, Alcentra , Apera , Benefit Street Partners , Brandywine Global Investment Management , Canvas , Clarion Partners , ClearBridge Investments , Fiduciary Trust International , Franklin , Franklin Mutual Series , K2 , Legg Mason , Lexington Partners , O'Shaughnessy , Putnam , Royce , Templeton and Western Asset Management Company . Unless otherwise indicated, our \"funds\" means the funds offered under our various brand names, which may include co-branded funds.","zh":"我們以各種不同的品牌名稱提供服務和產品，包括但不限於 Alcentra、Apera、Benefit Street Partners、Brandywine Global Investment Management、Canvas、Clarion Partners、ClearBridge Investments、Fiduciary Trust International、Franklin、Franklin Mutual Series、K2、Legg Mason、Lexington Partners、O'Shutington Partners、O'Shell、Pexington 和 Western Partners、Pexington Partners、O'Shell、Pexington 和 Western Partners。除非另有說明，我們的「基金」是指以我們的各種品牌名稱提供的基金，其中可能包括聯合品牌基金。"},{"en":"We are a global investment management organization with over $1.6 trillion in assets under management (\"AUM\") as of September 30, 2025. Our mission is to help clients achieve better outcomes through investment management expertise, wealth management and technology solutions. Through our specialist investment managers, we offer specialization on a global scale, bringing extensive capabilities in equity, fixed income, alternatives and multi-asset solutions. For over 75 years, we have been committed to providing clients with exceptional investment management services and have developed a globally diversified business, including through strategic acquisitions.","zh":"我們是一家全球投資管理組織，截至 2025 年 9 月 30 日，管理資產 (“AUM”) 超過 1.6 兆美元。我們的使命是透過投資管理專業知識、財富管理和技術解決方案幫助客戶取得更好的成果。透過我們的專業投資經理，我們在全球範圍內提供專業化服務，帶來股票、固定收益、另類投資和多資產解決方案的廣泛能力。 75 年來，我們致力於為客戶提供卓越的投資管理服務，並透過策略性收購等方式發展了全球多元化業務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The financial services industry is a highly competitive global environment. Competition is based on various factors, including, among others, business reputation, investment performance, product mix and offerings, service quality and innovation, distribution relationships, and fees charged. We face strong competition from numerous investment management companies, securities brokerage and investment banking firms, insurance companies, banks, hedge fund firms and other financial management institutions, which offer a wide range of financial and investment management services and products to the same retail, institutional and high-net-worth investors and accounts that we are seeking to attract. We offer a broad product mix that meets a variety of investment goals and needs for different investors, and we may periodically introduce new products to provide investors with additional investment","zh":"金融服務業是一個競爭激烈的全球環境。競爭基於多種因素，其中包括商業信譽、投資績效、產品組合和產品、服務品質和創新、分銷關係以及收取的費用。我們面臨著來自眾多投資管理公司、證券經紀和投資銀行公司、保險公司、銀行、對沖基金公司和其他金融管理機構的激烈競爭，這些機構向我們尋求吸引的零售、機構和高淨值投資者和帳戶提供廣泛的金融和投資管理服務和產品。我們提供廣泛的產品組合，滿足不同投資者的各種投資目標和需求，我們可能會定期推出新產品，為投資者提供額外的投資"},{"en":"We primarily derive our fund sales through third-party broker-dealers, banks, investment advisers and other financial intermediaries. Because we rely on third-party distribution and sales channels to sell our products, we do not control the ultimate investment recommendations given by them to clients. Such financial intermediaries may recommend competing products.","zh":"我們主要透過第三方經紀交易商、銀行、投資顧問和其他金融中介機構進行基金銷售。由於我們依賴第三方分銷和銷售管道來銷售我們的產品，因此我們無法控制他們向客戶提供的最終投資建議。此類金融中介機構可能會推薦競爭產品。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Investment Advisory Management & Administrative Service","val":6981800000,"zh":"投資諮詢管理及行政服務"},{"name":"Sales & Distribution Fees","val":1474700000,"zh":"銷售及分銷費用"},{"name":"Shareholder Service","val":264500000,"zh":"股東服務"},{"name":"Service Other","val":49700000,"zh":"服務其他"}],"total":8770700000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"US","val":6614200000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"LU","val":1295700000,"zh":"魯"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":327800000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Europe Middle Eastand Africa Excluding Luxembourg","val":279000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲（不包括盧森堡）"},{"name":"Americas Excluding United States","val":254000000,"zh":"美洲（不包括美國）"}],"total":8770700000}},"peers":["TROW","CINF","DOV","GPC","AFL"]}}